<title>USA: Wall Street stocks open narrowly mixed, Dow off.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks open narrowly mixed, Dow off.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks opened narrowly mixed on Tuesday, with the Dow off slightly but Nasdaq higher on strength in chip stocks.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials were down two to 5978 and the NASDAQ Index was up three to 1254.</p>
</text>
